# Cloudflare Pages _redirects: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# Format: <from> <to> <status>. ALWAYS write the status code. Cloudflare Pages defaults to 302
# (temporary), unlike Netlify, which defaults to 301. CI fails on a rule without a status code.
# Redirects from changing page URLs
/mentor-profiles /mentors 301
/student-profiles /students 301

